    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small sentient space rock that has crash landed onto an AI test range. Shoot and smash your way through everything to grow from a tiny pebble to a mountain of a force. As you bulk up you'll encounter angry bots that would love nothing more than to destroy you. Explode them first to gain powerful new abilities. If you're strong and skillful you just might EAT THE WORLD! Once you finish the main campaign you can create and share your own test ranges in the sandbox level editor or turn up the difficulty settings and try a speedrun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot -\u00a0enemy AI bots to unlock new weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash - through any and everything to grow large and powerful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share - the levels you create on the Steam Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little about me. I'm a solo dev working in the middle of the Pacific. I hope you love the game! :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small sentient space rock that has crash landed onto an AI test range. Shoot and smash your way through everything to grow from a tiny pebble to a mountain of a force. As you bulk up you'll encounter angry bots that would love nothing more than to destroy you. Explode them first to gain powerful new abilities. If you're strong and skillful you just might EAT THE WORLD! Once you finish the main campaign you can create and share your own test ranges in the sandbox level editor or turn up the difficulty settings and try a speedrun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot -\u00a0enemy AI bots to unlock new weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/b7633e97ebe4e92ae73f1a38ac25821b.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smash - through any and everything to grow large and powerful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/c011b5456fb5ccbb4f413e561ee747d5.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Share - the levels you create on the Steam Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.poster.avif?t=1755136643\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.webm?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752210/extras/1531960aa9a8b6bc388a0f59c04bdcce.mp4?t=1755136643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little about me. I'm a solo dev working in the middle of the Pacific. I hope you love the game! :)</p>",
    "short_description": "A high energy, physics driven shooter where everything can be destroyed and consumed. You are a small, sentient, space rock who's crashed on an AI test range. Fight angry bots to grow your size and abilities. Transform from a tiny pebble to a mountain of a force and you just might EAT THE WORLD!",
